%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=857b6cc8f803fffd01be7afce9220703", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7904a47e/uploads/origins/46247c6a-6186-413c-b273-18d9e8c91e86?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=857b6cc8f803fffd01be7afce9220703, https://si.imgix.net/7904a47e/uploads/origins/46247c6a-6186-413c-b273-18d9e8c91e86?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4d52b535f8b57392b5421d4da7f0937f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7904a47e/uploads/origins/46247c6a-6186-413c-b273-18d9e8c91e86?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ef3e4c968add93948fbd03c9006582d3 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello, your art is so cute!\n\nMy OC Rei is a sassy but sweet Fire Oni who runs a tavern! \n\nI really love this piece you did and would love for you to do something similar! \nhttps://skeb.jp/@ankz_chang/works/94\n\nFeel free to chose the outfit, expression and pose, I just ask that you include her pet <3\n\nShe has red at the top of her horns \nShe has fangs \n\nThanks so much!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1TG-hIQLyPGmpjzcRrjxYKHVSBKcov1AC?usp=drive_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ankz_chang/works/124", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a3c5a613/uploads/origins/e613add5-05b0-4902-ba7e-ab1a3ab2a3c0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=24e436060442f86f4b3b0f39effeb1c0", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a3c5a613/uploads/origins/e613add5-05b0-4902-ba7e-ab1a3ab2a3c0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=24e436060442f86f4b3b0f39effeb1c0, https://si.imgix.net/a3c5a613/uploads/origins/e613add5-05b0-4902-ba7e-ab1a3ab2a3c0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b78162ff57db7a7da43e5394514af4f0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a3c5a613/uploads/origins/e613add5-05b0-4902-ba7e-ab1a3a